      "content": "Thanks. That helps with the color aspects. I'm also seeing a lot of very fine, irregular fragmentation in this specific layer compared to the layers above it. The pieces seem almost randomly scattered across the trench floor. Is there any reason why certain firing methods would lead to more brittle, fragmented remains rather than larger, more intact shards?",
